+    // Same result as ggml_vec_dot_stq1_0_q8_K_generic (integer arithmetic):
+    // in each 64-weight chunk c, group g (0..15) holds weights c*64 + g + p*16
+    // (p = 0..3), so lane g of a 16-byte vector is group g, and the p-th 2-bit
